riables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$, and we have two free variables $y$ and $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y,z.$ Doing this, we get\n\n$$\nx=4y-3z-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=4y-3z-2 \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$, $z$ (free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4y-3z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400612 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400613 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400614 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400615 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400616 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1077 "selection" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400613 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400611 1080 #uuid "3bf381b7-5f27-5de3-b285-a0155244b022" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400612 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+y[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+z[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400612 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400612 1084 #uuid "9e094e93-8ced-5de7-8bbd-0b45c329cfff" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400613 1081 "[\\begi