$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=2y-3z-2 \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ and $z$ (the free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2y-3z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400626 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400627 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400628 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400629 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400630 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1077 "selection" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400627 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400625 1080 #uuid "452119fd-5ef0-59d8-810c-92339d03e4d1" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400626 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2-2y+3z \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400626 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400626 1084 #uuid "bae6d20c-cc44-51fa-982c-3eec6a0de3e8" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400627 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2y-3z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400627 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400627 1084 #uuid "b919b598-418f-5d14-b89f-506f59a55363" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400628 1081 "No solution" 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400628 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533482 17592186045585 true] [17592186400628 1084 #uuid "73bc07cb-54e5-5399-9562-2cbafc5